  m_Name: Note_ChickenSoupCard
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: GrandmasHouse::GrandmasHouse.Data.NoteData
  kind: 1
  title: Chicken Soup
  recipe: {fileID: 0}
  body: 'Chicken Soup


    A chicken, cut up on the board

    An onion and a carrot
    or two, sliced

    Water to cover, and a scoop of salt


    Everything into
    the pot, fill it at the sink, and let it boil a good long while. Ladle it out
    hot. Throw in an egg or two if the hens are laying.'
  marginNote: Ada Sorensen's. She says it'll fix anything but a broken heart.
